			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://techhub.social/@goulet\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>goulet</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@philhawksworth\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>philhawksworth</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@jaredwhite\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>jaredwhite</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.xyz/@remotesynth\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>remotesynth</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@brittneypostma\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>brittneypostma</span></a></span> this thread has some background: <a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/110860857025038126\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachle</span><span class=\"invisible\">at/110860857025038126</span></a></p>",
